{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他真想和对方共享幸福，可对方没给新保证，他怕幸福只属于自己，没法不在意对方会不会选他。\",\n      \"key\": \"共享幸福\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他曾不再查看对方是否在意，只管关心，安稳过一阵，可想被珍惜的心还是会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"想被珍惜会回来\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"text\": \"尽情喜欢确实让他幸福，可这两种做法都没法保证对方会选他。\",\n      \"key\": \"两种做法\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他不想把所有不安都交给对方解决，也不愿因怕落空就故意把喜欢压淡。\",\n      \"key\": \"压淡喜欢\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼对方主动靠近、把他放在心上，心里再难受，也不拿这份难受催对方，更不装作自己不在乎。\",\n      \"key\": \"假装自己不在乎\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"唤起\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S08-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R57\", \"R59\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把抽象的没有着落改成具体的互相选择之愿，保留幸福真实却仍怕只属于自己的矛盾，并用对方没有给新保证解释期待为何重新显现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分\",\n      \"why\": \"把克制一侧落到他曾不查回应、只管关心的实际经历，写清安稳只维持一阵，想被珍惜的心仍会回来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R58\", \"R61\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"保留尽情喜欢带来的幸福，以及两种做法都不能保证对方选择的认识；克制未能消除渴望的具体经历已由 S13-2 承接。保留 S13-3 编号及其双重局限的意思，供后段继续引用。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R60\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不把所有不安交给对方解决、也不因怕落空而压淡喜欢这两条边界，避免与下一条重复。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R62\", \"R63\", \"R64\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S13-5\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留仍盼对方主动选择、心里难受、不催促对方及不否认自己在乎的意思，把拒绝用自欺换平静落到具体选择上，删去连续宣告冲突和痛苦的重复总结。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "65a52bc9-63ae-4148-b85d-86894eab9697", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190218587874Z", "elapsed_seconds": 335.421, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:07:54.028173+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0acd4985dff9c9b4a843cc0f6315f27a692615da536349dc40e8febff77570e1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py